        <h2 class="has-mb-xs">What does he have that others don't?</h2>
        <p>Many of the talented people you could hire will be able to come up with spectacular visual concepts. But will they go quiet when asked to reveal their thought process, or explain how they intend to guide a user from point A to point B?</p>
        <p>If all you need is pretty graphics, I'm afraid you have to look elsewhere. By contrast, if you're looking for a partner in crime who can guide you, help you make important decisions, write your content AND give you thoughtful results on the visual front, then I'm your guy.</p>
        <p>Drawing on my skills in graphic design, UX, UI and content writing, as well as 8 years of experience in inbound marketing, I take an annoyingly thorough approach to my work, I'm not scared of revisions, and I bend over backwards (for which we have to thank my yoga teacher!) to deliver meaningful results to the highest standard, 99% of the time.</p>
